{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-color#card-zh","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-color","commit":"e4dbdbdc0447e9bc0e09ee5a9359604a5f36429f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-color 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的颜色工具插件，会把一组本地计算工具注册到现有和新建的 DSH agent。它能解析并转换 CSS 颜色格式、查询 CSS 命名颜色、计算 WCAG 文本对比度、生成多种和谐配色、调整或混合颜色、修复对比度、计算感知色差、生成 Oklab 色阶，并模拟色觉缺陷下的调色板效果。适合在设计、前端开发和无障碍检查时让 agent 协助处理颜色问题。源码配置为空对象，工具以输入颜色执行计算；不需要额外密钥、账号或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:57-73","src/tools.ts:281-287","src/tools.ts:342-345","src/tools.ts:1056-1064"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-color#card-en","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-color","commit":"e4dbdbdc0447e9bc0e09ee5a9359604a5f36429f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-color adds local color tools to DeepSeek Harness agents. It converts CSS colors, checks WCAG contrast, creates palettes, adjusts and blends colors, measures color difference, and simulates color-vision deficiency. Useful for design and accessibility work; no key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:57-73","src/tools.ts:281-287","src/tools.ts:342-345","src/tools.ts:1056-1064"]}
