{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-color#feature-1","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-color","commit":"e4dbdbdc0447e9bc0e09ee5a9359604a5f36429f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-color 的功能「颜色格式转换」：解析常见 CSS 颜色值并输出 hex、RGB、HSL、HWB 格式，可保留透明度。通过 agent 调用 convert_color，输入颜色和可选输出格式。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:282-295","src/tools.ts:325-338"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-color#feature-2","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-color","commit":"e4dbdbdc0447e9bc0e09ee5a9359604a5f36429f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-color 的功能「对比度检测与修复」：计算两种颜色的 WCAG 对比度并判断 AA/AAA 是否通过，也可为前景色寻找接近且达标的颜色。由 agent 调用对应工具并传入颜色与文本大小条件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:342-355","src/tools.ts:699-718"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-color#feature-3","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-color","commit":"e4dbdbdc0447e9bc0e09ee5a9359604a5f36429f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-color 的功能「配色与色阶生成」：根据主色生成互补、类似、三角等配色，或生成色调渐变色阶。调用 color_scheme 或 color_scale 并指定配色类型、渐变模式及步数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:480-495","src/tools.ts:956-979"]}
{"unit_id":"TYEclipse__dsh-color#feature-4","repo":"TYEclipse/dsh-color","commit":"e4dbdbdc0447e9bc0e09ee5a9359604a5f36429f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-color 的功能「色觉缺陷模拟」：模拟红色、绿色或蓝黄色觉缺陷下的颜色表现，并比较调色板颜色对的差异。由 agent 调用 cvd_simulate，输入一组颜色、类型和严重程度。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:1056-1086","src/color.ts:1178-1194"]}
